# The LivePortrait paste-back mask is an asset, not a screenshot. *.png above
# swallowed it, so CI built an image without it: cv2.imread returned nothing,
# the mask came out empty, and the failure surfaced on the pod as "no usable
# face in this image" - a bad photo, apparently, on a machine with no shell.
!deploy/liveportrait/assets/*.png
.afwork/
